WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.835
How to find the dark.

00:02.535 --> 00:06.723
Look at the lights around your own place, and pick a gap between them.

00:07.173 --> 00:12.012
Go there in the week around new Moon, when the Moon is out of the evening sky.

00:12.462 --> 00:16.390
Give your eyes half an hour in the dark, without a screen, and look up.
